            "content": "<h2>The acid problem</h2><p>Your stomach is designed to kill things. Stomach acid sits at a pH of 1–2 — about the same as battery acid — for the simple reason that most bacteria, viruses, and parasites that arrive with your food shouldn't make it any further. Unfortunately for conventional probiotic supplements, your stomach doesn't distinguish between the bad bacteria and the friendly cultures you swallowed on purpose.</p><p>Without protection, 99% of probiotic cultures in a typical capsule are destroyed within 30 minutes of swallowing. The handful that survive are too few to colonise effectively. The label says \"10 billion CFU\" but your gut sees less than 100 million.</p>"
